|description  = {{sbc|Passive:}} '''Yunara's''' {{tip|basic attacks}} deal {{as|'''bonus''' magic damage}} {{tip|on-hit}}. While this ability is inactive, her basic attacks {{tip|on-attack}} generate a {{tip|stack}} of ''Unleash'' for 6 seconds, increased to 2 stacks against {{tip|champions}}. The stacks refresh on subsequent attacks, stack up to 8 times, and expire one by one every {{fd|0.5}} seconds after the duration.
|leveling     = {{st|Passive Bonus Magic Damage|{{ap|{{#var:pb1}} to {{#var:pb5}}}} {{as|(+ {{#var:pap}}% AP)}}}}
|description2 = {{sbc|Active:}} '''Yunara''' unleashes for 5 seconds: gaining {{sti|{{as|'''bonus''' attack speed}}}}, dealing {{as|'''additional bonus''' magic damage|magic damage}} {{tip|on-hit}}, and augmenting her basic attacks to have increased missile speed, a 40% lower {{tip|attack windup|windup}} time, and an {{tip|uncancellable windup}}. Her basic attacks are also empowered to spread to each enemy near the target, dealing {{as|30% AD}} {{as|physical damage}}.<br>Each spread attack {{tip|applies lifesteal|applies}} {{as|{{sti|life steal}}}} and {{tip|on-hit}} effects, with on-hit damage reduced to 30% effectiveness, and will {{tip|critically strike}} for {{as|{{critical damage|{{ccd|Yunara|crit_base}}|100}}|critical damage}} damage if the triggering attack does. Spread attacks deal 250% damage against {{tip|minions}} {{as|below 30% '''maximum''' health}}.
