{{st|Active Increased Minion Damage|{{ap|{{#var:ab1}}*2.5 to {{#var:ab5}}*2.5}} {{as|(+ {{#expr:20*2.5}}% AP)}}|Combined Increased Minion Damage|{{ap|({{#var:pb1}}+{{#var:ab1}})*2.5 to ({{#var:pb5}}+{{#var:ab5}})*2.5}} {{as|(+ {{#expr:({{#var:aap}}+{{#var:pap}})*2.5}}% AP)}}}}
